    "text": "Why is \"spring break\" even a thing? College life isn't so tough that you need a week off after two months. If you do need a break, you're at the wrong school. If you just want to \"party,\" you shouldn't be in school at all. Without this spring break nonsense, they wouldn't have been there and likely would still be alive.\nAlso, why is the diver (yes, I meant diver, not driver) treated as far more important than the other two people that got killed in the crash? That's three people that are dead, sadly. RIP.",
